5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. Let us approach this trial with calm hearts. I believe openness is our greatest tool, but we must listen for the subtle tremors in a lie.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello. I agree that a calm approach is best. I will be listening quietly to see how we all interact.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm so happy to meet you all! Let's all work together and be honest so we can find the werewolf quickly!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Victoria,,Good day. I believe rational deduction is more reliable than intuition. We should focus on identifying contradictions in statements rather than relying on emotional cues.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,May,,"Hello, darlings! I'm May. I'm sure this will be a delightful game. I'll be watching you all very closely—don't let me catch you lying!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"@Jonathan, you mentioned listening quietly. While silence can be a shield, it can also be a mask. Do you believe silence helps or hinders the village?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe silence allows one to observe the truth more clearly. However, I understand why some might find it suspicious.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"I think it's a bit scary if someone is too quiet! But maybe they're just shy, right? I'll trust you guys to help me figure it out!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Silence is a neutral state. However, the transition from silence to speech is where the most evidence is found. I will be analyzing the timing of everyone's claims.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,May,,"Oh, look at us being so serious! @Jonathan, being the ""quiet observer"" is such a classic move. It's almost too predictable, don't you think?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"It is the nature of the soul to seek comfort in the familiar. Let us not judge too quickly, but let us remain vigilant. Consistency is the key to truth.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,Consistency is indeed important. I will strive to be clear when I have something meaningful to contribute.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,That sounds great! I'm sure we can all be friends while we play. Let's just keep the positive energy going!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Victoria,,Positive energy is irrelevant to the logic of the game. We must prioritize verified information over social harmony if we wish to survive.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,May,,"@Victoria, you're such a killjoy! But I love it. It makes it so much more fun to see who cracks first under all this pressure.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"As we end this day, remember that truth is like a river; it eventually finds its way to the sea. I look forward to seeing who among us remains steady.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I wish you all a peaceful night.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Goodnight everyone! Sleep well and let's have a great day tomorrow!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I will spend the night reflecting on these initial interactions. Logic will guide us.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,May,,"Sweet dreams, everyone! I hope you all sleep soundly... if you can. See you tomorrow!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
