64,2,1,talk,Yumi,,Oh no! Servas is gone! This is terrible! I can't believe it... everything is changing so fast!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Victoria,,Servas was a human. His death confirms the werewolf is still among us and is targeting those who lead the discussion. We are now down to four.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,May,,"Poor Servas. He was so poetic. But look at how panicked Yumi is! It's almost like she's trying too hard to seem shocked, don't you think?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'm not trying! I'm just really sad! Servas was so kind to us! @May, why are you being so mean right now?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@May, let us avoid baseless accusations. @Yumi's reaction is consistent with her established personality. We must look at the remaining players' reactions to the loss.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,May,,"I'm just being observant, Victoria. Yumi's ""sweetness"" is the perfect cover. Who better to hide a wolf's teeth than someone who acts like a little lamb?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm not a wolf! I just want us all to be safe! I'm scared now... I don't know who to trust if you're going to say that about me!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Yumi, please remain calm. @May, your accusations are purely speculative and lack the rational basis I require. We must identify the werewolf through elimination.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,May,,"Rationality is so dull. I'm following my gut, and my gut says Yumi is playing us all for fools. Look at her shaking! It's practically a confession.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'm not shaking because I'm lying, I'm shaking because I'm scared! @Victoria, please help me! I'm just a villager!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"I have verified information. @Yumi is human. Therefore, the werewolf must be @May. The logic is now absolute.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,May,,"Oh, honey, you really think a little ""verification"" is enough? You're just as fooled as Yumi is. But it's too late for you both.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
